# Without this file git rewrites text files to CRLF on checkout on Windows, and
# two things in this repo depend on exact bytes:
#
#   - knowledge_index.json stores a SHA-256 of sources.json. A CRLF rewrite changes
#     every line while changing no content, the hash stops matching, and the index
#     is rejected as stale - so a fresh clone answered every Cyber Saathi question
#     with 503 KNOWLEDGE_INDEX_INVALID.
#   - the Devanagari message catalogues are compared key-for-key between locales.
#
# The hashing side is also defended in code (see _source_pack_hash), because a
# checkout is not the only thing that can rewrite a newline.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalise these - they are not text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
